1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
=Godslayer=
(Adapted from the novel Godslayer.)

2
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,291
(Divine Era, Lunisolar Calendar,
Ninth Night)

3
00:00:34,291 --> 00:00:35,208
The Ascension Jade Disc

4
00:00:35,625 --> 00:00:36,791
has two faces: god and monster.

5
00:00:37,125 --> 00:00:38,208
(Lower City Arena)
The toss decides who chooses the arena.

6
00:00:38,583 --> 00:00:39,666
(Lower City Arena)
If it lands on the monster face,

7
00:00:39,666 --> 00:00:41,541
(Lower City Arena)
the Challenger chooses the arena.

8
00:00:42,916 --> 00:00:43,916
If it lands on the god face,

9
00:00:43,916 --> 00:00:46,000
the Defender chooses.

10
00:00:53,375 --> 00:00:54,625
The Lower City has three arenas,

11
00:00:54,625 --> 00:00:55,708
each with two aspects,

12
00:00:56,041 --> 00:00:57,083
embodying six forces:

13
00:00:57,291 --> 00:01:00,875
Thunder, Wind, Water, Fire, Mountain,
and Marsh.

14
00:01:01,166 --> 00:01:02,041
Each has its strengths,

15
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:03,333
and each has its counter.

16
00:01:03,583 --> 00:01:05,041
(Challenger)
(Thunder is born from the clouds.)

17
00:01:05,208 --> 00:01:06,666
(Mountain blocks the path of wind
and cloud.)

18
00:01:06,875 --> 00:01:07,833
(Without flowing clouds,)

19
00:01:07,833 --> 00:01:09,166
(thunder cannot rise.)

20
00:01:09,375 --> 00:01:10,583
(If we get the Mountain field,)

21
00:01:10,583 --> 00:01:11,667
(we can counter Thunder.)

22
00:01:12,041 --> 00:01:13,333
(Defender)
(As long as we get the Thunder field,)

23
00:01:13,541 --> 00:01:14,708
(they're as good as dead.)

24
00:01:14,791 --> 00:01:15,791
(Everything's been taken care of.)

25
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,250
(It'll land on the god face.)

26
00:01:26,083 --> 00:01:27,083
What are you doing?

27
00:01:28,291 --> 00:01:29,083
(Defender)
He's trying to cheat!

28
00:01:29,458 --> 00:01:31,083
We can't let him choose the arena!

29
00:01:42,750 --> 00:01:43,958
What's that supposed to mean?

30
00:01:44,458 --> 00:01:45,250
No need to look.

31
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:46,791
You choose.

32
00:01:50,583 --> 00:01:51,458
I choose Thunder!

33
00:01:53,958 --> 00:01:54,750
Whelp,

34
00:01:55,125 --> 00:01:56,166
in a Thunder arena,

35
00:01:56,541 --> 00:01:58,333
heavenly thunder
is amplified severalfold.

36
00:01:58,500 --> 00:02:00,250
You're dead.

37
00:02:02,250 --> 00:02:03,041
You're scared?

38
00:02:03,083 --> 00:02:03,875
Nonsense!

39
00:02:04,416 --> 00:02:05,250
If you're not scared,

40
00:02:06,250 --> 00:02:07,500
why choose Thunder?

41
00:02:07,708 --> 00:02:08,625
I chose Thunder

42
00:02:08,625 --> 00:02:10,666
to make your death even more miserable.

43
00:02:11,458 --> 00:02:12,708
The one who should be scared

44
00:02:14,916 --> 00:02:15,958
is you!

45
00:02:21,416 --> 00:02:22,458
Chicken out and you're my son.

46
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:24,541
No, my grandson.

47
00:02:29,583 --> 00:02:30,291
(Qi Family)
Dad.

48
00:02:30,791 --> 00:02:32,000
(Qi Family)
That strike he used to kill Heyu

49
00:02:32,416 --> 00:02:33,500
had at least twenty years of cultivation
behind it.

50
00:02:33,875 --> 00:02:34,791
Can I withstand that?

51
00:02:35,333 --> 00:02:36,625
You have to, whether you can or not.

52
00:02:37,083 --> 00:02:38,166
Tomorrow's fight

53
00:02:38,458 --> 00:02:40,291
is about the honor of our sect.

54
00:02:40,916 --> 00:02:42,125
(Qi Hao's Father)
You must win.

55
00:02:42,666 --> 00:02:43,625
(Qi Hao's Father)
Losing is not an option.

56
00:02:46,833 --> 00:02:48,166
But, Dad...

57
00:02:48,500 --> 00:02:49,791
If I lose,

58
00:02:50,416 --> 00:02:51,541
I'll die.

59
00:02:53,541 --> 00:02:54,583
Sometimes,

60
00:02:54,583 --> 00:02:57,250
a fight isn't decided in the arena.

61
00:02:58,625 --> 00:03:00,625
Tomorrow, all you need to do
is step into the arena.

62
00:03:01,208 --> 00:03:02,375
Everything outside it

63
00:03:02,958 --> 00:03:04,458
will be taken care of.

64
00:03:10,416 --> 00:03:12,291
Do you have any rooms left?

65
00:03:13,250 --> 00:03:13,875
Sorry.

66
00:03:13,875 --> 00:03:15,250
We're closed for the night.

67
00:03:16,958 --> 00:03:18,083
Now I get it.

68
00:03:18,458 --> 00:03:19,375
Not one inn in the Capital

69
00:03:19,375 --> 00:03:20,916
will take half-monsters.

70
00:03:22,625 --> 00:03:23,250
Forget it.

71
00:03:23,750 --> 00:03:25,166
We'll make do in an alley tonight.

72
00:03:25,625 --> 00:03:27,333
Miss, Misters.

73
00:03:28,375 --> 00:03:30,625
The people of the Lower City
may not know how to treat guests,

74
00:03:30,833 --> 00:03:32,333
(Meiniang)
but I do.

75
00:03:32,500 --> 00:03:34,500
(Meiniang)
Why not come to my Flower Boat Row

76
00:03:35,083 --> 00:03:36,083
(Meiniang)
and stay the night?

77
00:03:42,900 --> 00:03:44,166
(Flower Boat Row)

78
00:03:44,166 --> 00:03:46,791
The Rouge River winds
around the Lower City.

79
00:03:47,250 --> 00:03:48,708
Along its banks lies Flower Boat Row.

80
00:03:48,958 --> 00:03:50,541
All seventy-two flower boats

81
00:03:50,541 --> 00:03:52,541
belong to me.

82
00:03:53,625 --> 00:03:55,416
Dad, aren't they half-monsters?

83
00:03:55,500 --> 00:03:57,166
Why do they look just like us?

84
00:03:57,375 --> 00:03:59,125
Once the lights go out
and the shops close,

85
00:03:59,208 --> 00:04:00,875
their monster faces will show.

86
00:04:01,083 --> 00:04:02,291
So don't wander off.

87
00:04:02,666 --> 00:04:04,250
With the gods watching over us,

88
00:04:04,625 --> 00:04:06,500
those monsters and ghouls
won't dare come near.

89
00:04:07,958 --> 00:04:08,750
Okay.

90
00:04:09,250 --> 00:04:11,666
What you three did was impressive.

91
00:04:12,583 --> 00:04:15,208
I've always had a soft spot for heroes.

92
00:04:15,750 --> 00:04:18,291
Flower Boat Row may not be fancy,

93
00:04:18,666 --> 00:04:20,708
but we'll take good care of you.

94
00:04:21,500 --> 00:04:23,291
A-Two, guests arriving!

95
00:04:27,958 --> 00:04:30,125
(Help! Help!)

96
00:04:30,291 --> 00:04:31,625
(I don't want to go back!)

97
00:04:34,333 --> 00:04:35,458
(Grab her!)

98
00:04:37,666 --> 00:04:38,791
(Help!)

99
00:04:52,791 --> 00:04:53,583
What's wrong?

100
00:04:58,750 --> 00:04:59,541
Nothing.

101
00:04:59,875 --> 00:05:00,958
Yan,

102
00:05:00,958 --> 00:05:02,625
I remember the Chief saying

103
00:05:02,666 --> 00:05:03,875
you'd been to the Capital before.

104
00:05:05,791 --> 00:05:07,083
That was many years ago.

105
00:05:07,833 --> 00:05:08,791
I barely remember it.

106
00:05:40,416 --> 00:05:41,458
Mr. Lu.

107
00:05:41,750 --> 00:05:43,000
Hope I'm not disturbing you.

108
00:05:43,583 --> 00:05:45,625
I warmed some wine for you.

109
00:05:45,875 --> 00:05:46,916
It'll take the chill off.

110
00:05:47,583 --> 00:05:48,375
Thanks.

111
00:05:51,833 --> 00:05:53,083
Nights are cold.

112
00:05:53,541 --> 00:05:54,875
Have some warm wine.

113
00:05:55,250 --> 00:05:56,625
It'll warm you up.

114
00:05:58,625 --> 00:06:00,125
Confident about tomorrow?

115
00:06:01,083 --> 00:06:02,958
The Qi Sect has stood
for a hundred years.

116
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,750
Are you here to talk me
into backing down?

117
00:06:07,875 --> 00:06:09,375
I'm only worried about you.

118
00:06:10,291 --> 00:06:12,500
Young Master Qi has the Thunder field
on his side.

119
00:06:12,958 --> 00:06:14,000
You only have Headwind.

120
00:06:14,625 --> 00:06:15,916
This fight

121
00:06:16,083 --> 00:06:17,791
won't be easy.

122
00:06:18,250 --> 00:06:19,750
Then do you have a way

123
00:06:20,041 --> 00:06:21,875
to help me turn things around
in the arena?

124
00:06:22,083 --> 00:06:25,041
I don't know much about fighting
in the arena.

125
00:06:25,041 --> 00:06:28,166
But what happens outside it?
That I understand.

126
00:06:29,583 --> 00:06:31,458
I'm a businesswoman.

127
00:06:31,750 --> 00:06:33,625
You entered the Ascension Trials

128
00:06:33,875 --> 00:06:36,166
just to save your sister, didn't you?

129
00:06:37,958 --> 00:06:39,416
I can help you.

130
00:06:41,333 --> 00:06:42,208
How?

131
00:06:42,625 --> 00:06:44,458
I have people in the Ministry of Rites.

132
00:06:44,750 --> 00:06:47,666
I can send a girl from Flower Boat Row
in her place

133
00:06:47,958 --> 00:06:50,250
and have your sister returned
to you unharmed.

134
00:06:50,875 --> 00:06:52,250
How much

135
00:06:52,625 --> 00:06:53,708
for this job?

136
00:06:54,583 --> 00:06:55,583
In the Capital,

137
00:06:55,708 --> 00:06:56,708
human life

138
00:06:57,958 --> 00:06:59,208
is worthless.

139
00:07:00,958 --> 00:07:03,500
My business needs
the Qi family's protection.

140
00:07:04,041 --> 00:07:05,458
I want you

141
00:07:05,583 --> 00:07:07,500
to lose to the Qi family

142
00:07:08,958 --> 00:07:10,625
within one incense stick.

143
00:07:11,541 --> 00:07:12,833
You work for the Qi family?

144
00:07:13,375 --> 00:07:15,166
I work for whoever pays.

145
00:07:16,416 --> 00:07:18,375
You're still young.

146
00:07:19,583 --> 00:07:20,958
You haven't learned yet.

147
00:07:21,708 --> 00:07:23,541
If you want to change your fate,

148
00:07:23,958 --> 00:07:26,291
there's something sharper
than your blade.

149
00:07:29,125 --> 00:07:31,250
Money.

150
00:07:51,041 --> 00:07:52,291
In the Ascension Trials,

151
00:07:52,333 --> 00:07:53,583
three arenas fight at once.

152
00:07:53,875 --> 00:07:56,000
Winners may cross over
to aid their teammates.

153
00:07:56,333 --> 00:07:57,375
Once the fighting begins,

154
00:07:57,458 --> 00:07:58,833
blades show no mercy.

155
00:07:59,083 --> 00:08:00,291
Life or death, there are no guarantees.

156
00:08:01,916 --> 00:08:03,291
Begin!

157
00:08:15,583 --> 00:08:16,958
Get him! Get him!

158
00:08:35,416 --> 00:08:38,375
This is the Qi Sect's mystic artifact,
the Linglong Beads.

159
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,125
The Ling Bead becomes a mace,

160
00:08:40,750 --> 00:08:42,041
and the Long Bead becomes armor.

161
00:08:46,333 --> 00:08:47,541
(That's the Qi family's
Heavenly Thunder Armor.)

162
00:08:47,875 --> 00:08:48,583
(With heavenly thunder protecting him,)

163
00:08:48,583 --> 00:08:50,041
(that half-monster can't even
get close.)

164
00:09:00,541 --> 00:09:01,291
Young Master Qi is

165
00:09:01,291 --> 00:09:02,375
using the Thunder field

166
00:09:02,625 --> 00:09:03,958
to amplify his heavenly thunder.

167
00:09:03,958 --> 00:09:05,000
Without the Thunder field,

168
00:09:05,166 --> 00:09:06,625
no matter how powerful
the Linglong Beads are,

169
00:09:06,625 --> 00:09:07,583
they couldn't unleash their full power.

170
00:09:13,708 --> 00:09:14,416
My son,

171
00:09:14,416 --> 00:09:15,583
scared?

172
00:09:15,583 --> 00:09:16,541
Today,

173
00:09:17,166 --> 00:09:19,958
I'll show you the true power
of heavenly thunder!

174
00:09:32,416 --> 00:09:34,458
And I thought you had some backbone.

175
00:09:35,083 --> 00:09:38,333
Turns out you're just cheap trash
who can be bought.

176
00:09:38,541 --> 00:09:39,375
Draw your blade!

177
00:09:40,083 --> 00:09:40,875
Too scared to move?

178
00:09:46,375 --> 00:09:47,791
I want you

179
00:09:47,875 --> 00:09:49,541
to lose to the Qi family

180
00:09:50,041 --> 00:09:51,208
within one incense stick.

181
00:09:51,833 --> 00:09:53,000
Why one incense stick?

182
00:09:53,375 --> 00:09:54,875
The arena is charged
with heavenly thunder

183
00:09:54,875 --> 00:09:56,500
for one incense stick.

184
00:09:56,708 --> 00:09:58,083
Once the incense burns out,

185
00:09:58,083 --> 00:09:59,583
the arena's element resets.

186
00:09:59,791 --> 00:10:01,875
Before the next charge begins,

187
00:10:01,875 --> 00:10:03,750
there's a brief opening.

188
00:10:05,791 --> 00:10:07,666
(Time is up.)

189
00:10:08,083 --> 00:10:09,708
(This is my only chance
to turn the fight around.)

190
00:10:12,625 --> 00:10:13,833
Is that all you've got?

191
00:10:14,333 --> 00:10:15,416
Didn't eat enough today?

192
00:10:18,750 --> 00:10:20,541
I will make it quick for you.

193
00:10:29,791 --> 00:10:31,958
(Young Master Qi has the Thunder field
on his side.)

194
00:10:32,291 --> 00:10:33,125
(You only have Headwind.)

195
00:10:33,208 --> 00:10:36,125
(Each arena has two aspects,
each with its strengths and counters.)

196
00:10:36,125 --> 00:10:37,166
(Mountain blocks the path of wind
and cloud.)

197
00:10:37,166 --> 00:10:39,250
(Without flowing clouds,
thunder cannot rise.)

198
00:10:52,083 --> 00:10:54,250
The arena flipped!

199
00:11:04,166 --> 00:11:05,416
Grandson.

200
00:11:25,916 --> 00:11:27,166
It's the Mountain field now!

201
00:11:27,166 --> 00:11:28,291
Mountain counters Thunder!

202
00:11:28,458 --> 00:11:29,625
Crap!

203
00:11:42,125 --> 00:11:42,916
Well, well.

204
00:11:43,416 --> 00:11:44,958
No sleeping in the arena.

205
00:11:48,083 --> 00:11:49,208
What?

206
00:11:49,208 --> 00:11:50,375
Not playing Daddy anymore?

207
00:11:50,833 --> 00:11:51,583
You...

208
00:11:53,250 --> 00:11:55,083
Didn't you make a deal with Meiniang?

209
00:11:55,833 --> 00:11:56,625
I had to agree.

210
00:11:56,916 --> 00:11:59,208
How else would I know
the arena's element resets?

211
00:11:59,333 --> 00:12:01,333
And without the reset,
how could I turn the fight around?

212
00:12:01,708 --> 00:12:02,541
You...

213
00:12:03,166 --> 00:12:04,166
Shameless!

214
00:12:04,708 --> 00:12:05,916
You broke your word!

215
00:12:05,916 --> 00:12:07,583
You're the one who broke your word.

216
00:12:08,041 --> 00:12:10,083
Ahai held out for half an incense stick.

217
00:12:10,083 --> 00:12:11,083
Did you open the gate?

218
00:12:11,750 --> 00:12:13,416
And the crystals you owed him?

219
00:12:13,416 --> 00:12:14,500
Did you pay?

220
00:12:17,875 --> 00:12:18,958
To hell with you!

221
00:12:24,791 --> 00:12:25,958
I surrender! I surrender!

222
00:12:26,375 --> 00:12:27,500
Listen up.

223
00:12:28,041 --> 00:12:29,250
I'll ask you one question.

224
00:12:29,625 --> 00:12:31,000
Answer correctly,

225
00:12:31,333 --> 00:12:32,875
and I'll spare your sorry life.

226
00:12:33,625 --> 00:12:37,250
Are sesame cakes sweet?

227
00:12:37,333 --> 00:12:38,416
What are you talking about?

228
00:12:43,291 --> 00:12:44,375
(He'd definitely stand up for us)

229
00:12:44,541 --> 00:12:45,750
(and fight for justice.)

230
00:12:58,416 --> 00:13:00,916
The Challenger wins!

231
00:13:00,916 --> 00:13:03,500
Defender's all equipment

232
00:13:03,500 --> 00:13:06,916
now belongs to
the victorious Challenger!

233
00:13:26,708 --> 00:13:27,708
He's dead!

234
00:13:27,708 --> 00:13:29,166
Fiend! She's a fiend!

235
00:13:47,083 --> 00:13:47,833
Fiend!

236
00:13:47,833 --> 00:13:48,791
Fiend is here!

237
00:13:48,833 --> 00:13:49,875
A half-monster killed someone!

238
00:13:50,083 --> 00:13:51,458
They've brought their killing
into the Lower City!

239
00:13:51,458 --> 00:13:52,166
Gods above!

240
00:13:52,166 --> 00:13:52,875
Gods above!

241
00:13:52,875 --> 00:13:54,041
Drive them out!

242
00:13:54,125 --> 00:13:58,958
Drive them out of the Capital!
Drive them out!

243
00:14:00,041 --> 00:14:00,875
I thought

244
00:14:00,875 --> 00:14:03,041
you'd agreed to Meiniang's deal
last night.

245
00:14:03,083 --> 00:14:04,333
Drive them out of the Capital!

246
00:14:04,375 --> 00:14:06,333
(Money.)

247
00:14:10,958 --> 00:14:12,583
I won't trade someone else's life

248
00:14:12,875 --> 00:14:14,166
for my sister's.

249
00:14:20,666 --> 00:14:23,375
Let me tell you a story.

250
00:14:27,416 --> 00:14:30,833
Once, there was a little girl named Jiu.

251
00:14:31,375 --> 00:14:33,208
She once went to Yuyou Village.

252
00:14:34,458 --> 00:14:36,000
Jiu was from the Capital.

253
00:14:36,625 --> 00:14:38,000
Her parents were merchants.

254
00:14:38,666 --> 00:14:41,583
Their business failed,
leaving them deep in debt.

255
00:14:42,208 --> 00:14:44,041
Meiniang brought her to Flower Boat Row.

256
00:14:44,708 --> 00:14:46,250
It became

257
00:14:46,791 --> 00:14:49,208
the darkest time of her life.

258
00:14:49,208 --> 00:14:50,500
♪Reaching out again and again♪

259
00:14:50,500 --> 00:14:51,416
Later,

260
00:14:52,208 --> 00:14:54,458
Meiniang sent Jiu to Yuyou Village,

261
00:14:55,083 --> 00:14:56,500
to take another girl's place

262
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:58,666
as an offering to the gods.

263
00:14:58,666 --> 00:15:00,083
♪You speak without a sound♪

264
00:15:00,083 --> 00:15:01,458
Outsiders all believed

265
00:15:01,458 --> 00:15:03,375
Yuyou Village was home to the gods.

266
00:15:04,166 --> 00:15:05,041
But in truth,

267
00:15:05,541 --> 00:15:08,458
it was nothing but a playground
for the guardian gods.

268
00:15:10,541 --> 00:15:12,125
To escape,

269
00:15:12,333 --> 00:15:14,250
Jiu jumped from Mount Buzhou.

270
00:15:15,083 --> 00:15:16,083
She fell into a pool

271
00:15:16,208 --> 00:15:17,166
and was tainted by monster aura.

272
00:15:18,416 --> 00:15:19,583
Later,

273
00:15:19,666 --> 00:15:21,916
the Chief of Redtail saved her.

274
00:15:21,916 --> 00:15:23,250
♪I long for impermanence♪

275
00:15:23,250 --> 00:15:24,458
From that day on,

276
00:15:25,250 --> 00:15:27,708
the girl named Jiu was gone.

277
00:15:28,666 --> 00:15:29,833
And Redtail

278
